('4518','https://news.mit.edu/2026/how-data-centers-can-better-manage-energy-use-0626','How data centers can better manage energy use ','A new study shows that if data centers move a significant portion of their energy consumption to non-peak hours, it could help lower average energy costs in the U.S. The environmental impact of these changes, in terms of the type of energy consumed, would differ by region.','Peter Dizikes | MIT News','2026-07-15 17:10:43+00',NULL,'2026-09-16 10:52:23.329599+00','medium','university','EN','f','f','f','mit_news','MIT News','https://news.mit.edu','Все'),
